  "Melo Client & Services": "Melo 客户端与服务",
  "Anti-Piracy & Content Responsibility": "反盗版与内容责任",
  "Anti-Piracy & Content Liability Disclaimer": "反盗版与内容免责声明",
  "Melo strictly prohibits illegal streaming and piracy of copyrighted media. Melo operates purely as a front-end client interface. We do not provide, collect, index, or store media files. The user is entirely responsible for the audio content stored on their Jellyfin server or accessed via podcast subscriptions.": "Melo 严禁非法流式传输和盗版受版权保护的媒体。Melo 仅作为前端客户端界面运行。我们不提供、收集、索引或存储媒体文件。用户对其 Jellyfin 服务器上存储或通过播客订阅访问的音频内容承担全部责任。",
  "Melo does not host, provide, encourage, or endorse piracy or the unauthorized sharing of copyrighted songs and audio media. This application acts strictly as a web client interface designed to connect to your own self-hosted Jellyfin media server or public RSS podcast feeds. You, as the user, are solely responsible and legally liable for all content, music, audio files, and media accessed, streamed, or stored through your server or client instance.": "Melo 不托管、提供、鼓励或支持盗版或未经授权共享受版权保护的歌曲和音频媒体。此应用程序仅作为 Web 客户端界面，旨在连接到您自己的自托管 Jellyfin 媒体服务器或公共 RSS 播客源。作为用户，您对通过您的服务器或客户端实例访问、流式传输或存储的所有内容、音乐、音频文件和媒体承担全部法律责任。",
  "1. Information We Do Not Collect": "1. 我们不收集的信息",
  "Melo does not harvest, sell, or collect personal data, listening habits, login credentials, or server URLs. We do not run third-party tracking scripts, analytics tools, or advertising networks.": "Melo 不会收集、出售或获取个人数据、收听习惯、登录凭据或服务器 URL。我们不运行第三方跟踪脚本、分析工具或广告网络。",
  "2. Server Communication & Connection": "2. 服务器通信与连接",
  "When you log in to your self-hosted Jellyfin server through Melo, authentication requests and API calls are sent directly from your browser to your designated Jellyfin server endpoint. No credentials or server tokens are ever routed through external third-party servers managed by Melo.": "当您通过 Melo 登录到自托管的 Jellyfin 服务器时，身份验证请求和 API 调用将直接从您的浏览器发送到您指定的 Jellyfin 服务器端点。任何凭据或服务器令牌都不会通过 Melo 管理的外部第三方服务器进行路由。",
  "3. Local Data Storage": "3. 本地数据存储",
  "Melo utilizes your web browser's localStorage and IndexedDB to save your user preferences (such as light/dark theme preference, sidebar state, server URL, authentication tokens, and cached podcast data). This data remains strictly stored on your local device and can be cleared at any time through your browser settings or by signing out.": "Melo 利用网络浏览器的 localStorage 和 IndexedDB 来保存您的用户偏好设置（例如浅色/深色主题偏好、侧边栏状态、服务器 URL、身份验证令牌和缓存的播客数据）。这些数据严格保存在您的本地设备上，您可以随时通过浏览器设置或退出登录来清除这些数据。",
  "4. External Podcast Feeds": "4. 外部播客源",
  "If you choose to subscribe to or search for podcasts within Melo, direct HTTPS requests are made to public podcast feed URLs and iTunes Search APIs to retrieve show artwork and audio enclosures. These third-party services operate under their respective privacy policies.": "如果您选择在 Melo 中订阅或搜索播客，系统将向公共播客源 URL 和 iTunes 搜索 API 发出直接 HTTPS 请求以获取节目封面和音频文件。这些第三方服务根据各自的隐私政策运行。",
  "5. User Liability": "5. 用户责任",
  "Users are solely liable for ensuring that all content accessed through their self-hosted server or external audio streams complies with relevant copyright laws and licensing requirements in their jurisdiction.": "用户应全权负责确保通过其自托管服务器或外部音频流访问的所有内容均符合其所在管辖范围内的相关版权法和许可要求。",
  "1. Acceptance of Terms": "1. 接受条款",
  "By accessing or using the Melo application, you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, you should not use this application.": "通过访问或使用 Melo 应用程序，您同意遵守这些服务条款并受其约束。如果您不同意这些条款，则不应使用此应用程序。",
  "2. Description of Service": "2. 服务说明",
  "Melo is a client-side Progressive Web Application (PWA) that allows users to stream audio from their personal, self-hosted Jellyfin servers and listen to podcast RSS feeds. Melo does not provide media libraries, subscription music streams, or hosted audio files.": "Melo 是一款客户端渐进式 Web 应用 (PWA)，允许用户从其个人自托管 Jellyfin 服务器流式传输音频并收听播客 RSS 源。Melo 不提供媒体库、订阅音乐流或托管音频文件。",
  "3. Copyright & Intellectual Property": "3. 版权与知识产权",
  "All trademarks, logos, and brand names are the property of their respective owners. Melo respects intellectual property rights and expects users to do the same. Users must ensure that they have the necessary rights, licenses, or legal permission to stream any audio files stored on their media servers.": "所有商标、徽标和品牌名称均为其各自所有者的财产。Melo 尊重知识产权，并期望用户也这样做。用户必须确保其拥有在媒体服务器上存储并流式传输任何音频文件所需的必要权利、许可或合法权限。",
  "4. User Responsibilities & Liability": "4. 用户责任与法律责任",
  "You agree to use Melo in compliance with all applicable local, national, and international laws. You are exclusively liable for any illegal, unauthorized, or infringing content transmitted through your personal server setup. The developers of Melo assume no liability for misuse of the software or copyright violations committed by users.": "您同意在遵守所有适用的地方、国家和国际法律的前提下使用 Melo。您对通过您的个人服务器设置传输的任何非法、未经授权或侵权的内容承担全部责任。Melo 开发者对软件的滥用或用户犯下的版权侵权行为不承担任何责任。",
  "5. Limitation of Liability": "5. 责任限制",
  "Melo is provided \"as is\" without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied. In no event shall the creators or contributors of Melo be liable for any damages, legal claims, or data loss resulting from the use or inability to use this application.": "Melo 按“原样”提供，不提供任何明示或暗示的保证。在任何情况下，Melo 的创建者或贡献者均不对因使用或无法使用本应用程序而导致的任何损害、法律索赔或数据丢失承担责任。"
}
